      "comment": "Ella Musk: Hilichurlian and the Ballad Selection",
      "content": "Ella gives the Traveler Hilichurl Ballad Selection, Vol. 2, by Jacob Musk, which records hilichurl songs, such as an ode sung by shamans and a pious sacrifice song. The text reads them with scholarly caution about hilichurl philosophy.\n\nJacob Musk observes that wind-worshipping tribes drink and sing endless songs of praise to the wind. These are claims in an in-world book, not settled lore.",
